### Base
@host = http://localhost:8080

### Time range examples (UTC ms)
### 2026-04-25T00:00:00Z
@from = 1777075200000
### 2026-04-26T00:00:00Z
@to = 1777161600000

### Common params
@instId = BTC-USDT
@bucketMs = 60000
@bucketSec = 3600

### 1) Overview cards
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard/overview

### 2) Price summary (window supports: 15m / 24h / 7d)
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard/price/summary?window=24h&limit=20

### 3) Price trend (candles/line source)
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard/price/trend?instId={{instId}}&from={{from}}&to={{to}}&bucketMs={{bucketMs}}&limit=2000

### 4) Backfill summary
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard/backfill/summary?from={{from}}&to={{to}}

### 5) Backfill task list (status optional: QUEUED/RUNNING/SUCCEEDED/FAILED)
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard/backfill/tasks?page=0&size=20&status=RUNNING&instId={{instId}}

### 6) Alert summary (trend + severity + top rules)
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard/alerts/summary?from={{from}}&to={{to}}&bucketSec={{bucketSec}}&topRules=10

### 7) Recent alerts
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard/alerts/recent?limit=50

### 8) Health (ws providers + recent error signal)
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard/health

### 9) Solana SPL refresh failure top
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard/solana/spl-failures?from={{from}}&to={{to}}&top=20

### 10) Monitoring tree for dashboard table/sidebar
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard/monitoring/tree?enabledOnly=true&limit=200
